  "prefLabel": "We 1002.01 Registry",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 1002.01 Registry. The board shall maintain a registry of complaints which have been determined by the board to be credible based on the information contained in the complaint and any subsequent investigation conducted by the board.\n\nSource. #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9179, eff 6-13-08; ss by #12083, eff 3-1-17",
